hpc:CpuT a owl:Class .
hpc:Turnaround a owl:Class .
hpc:Status a owl:Class .
hpc:HogFactor a owl:Class .

hpc:hascpuT a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:float .

hpc:hasturnaround a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:float .

hpc:hasstatus a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:hashogFactor a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:float .

hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:Job a rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Resource ] .

hpc:Task a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Job .


This ontology fragment defines classes for CPU time, turnaround time, status, and hog factor, as well as a Job class that is a subclass of rdf:Resource. It also defines object properties for each of the accounted-for aspects of a job, with the domain being the Job class.
